  "translation": "Na dispela yia i pinis, ol i kam long em long nambatru yia, na ol i tok long em: Mipela i no ken haitim long bikman bilong mipela — long wanem, mani i pinis olgeta, na ol animal bilong lukautim i stap long bikman bilong mipela; i no gat samting i stap pastaim long bikman bilong mipela, sai bodi bilong mipela na graun bilong mipela.",
